Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\2c&HB78DBC&\3c&HC896B3&\4c&HD6680A&\pos(1501,778)}Sergeant Serjean\NDance Instructor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you who chose my lesson,\Na wise decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you all into fine soldiers\Nwith my military-style dance training!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the lessons start today.\NI'm gonna give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Santhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Present~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? I don't see them anywhere.\NAre they absent?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This girl disappears\Nwhen she gets nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we'll strengthen your core!\N10-minute plank!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Santhi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubnacchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for becoming...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubnacchi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You there! Are you alright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for today's training!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubnacchi, you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\2c&HB78DBC&\3c&HC896B3&\4c&HD6680A&\pos(1618,773)}Rougia\NSinger of FL∀MMe-Glam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some water?\
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, much thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming back to life...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh~ Rougia, you've already debuted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.98,0:01:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm the singer for\Na unit called FL∀MMe-Glam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I only enrolled a little before you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I wanna debut already, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-Will I ever be able to debut?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sympathy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She showed me footage of\NFL∀MMe-Glam's live performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I get really excited when I hold a mic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,1076)\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&}Because you are the one who gives me courage!
